            <ArticleTitle>&quot;CF asthma&quot;: what is it and what do we do about it?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>742-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The diagnosis of &quot;CF asthma&quot; is problematic and it is difficult to determine which patients have a combination of CF and asthma and which have asthma like symptoms caused by inflammation of the CF lung. This may not matter, however; the relevance lies in the possible approaches to treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
